1
00:00:27,692 --> 00:00:33,692
Thriller Night is a animation, music, horror film directed by Sean Bishop.

2
00:00:55,384 --> 00:01:01,384
A Shrek parody of Michael Jackson's Thriller song
and music video, with Donkey singing.

3
00:01:23,076 --> 00:01:29,076
Shrek (voice), played by Michael Gough.

4
00:01:50,769 --> 00:01:56,769
Donkey (voice), played by Dean Edwards.

5
00:02:18,461 --> 00:02:24,461
Princess Fiona (voice), played by Holly Fields.

6
00:02:46,153 --> 00:02:52,153
Puss in Boots (voice), played by André Sogliuzzo.

7
00:03:13,846 --> 00:03:19,846
Pinocchio / Three Pigs (voice), played by Cody Cameron.

8
00:03:41,538 --> 00:03:47,538
Gingerbread Man (voice), played by Conrad Vernon.

9
00:04:09,230 --> 00:04:15,230
Sleepless Night (French: Nuit Blanche) is a 2011 French-language action thriller film
directed by Frédéric Jardin, who co-wrote the story with Nicolas Saada.

10
00:04:36,923 --> 00:04:42,923
The film stars Tomer Sisley, Adel Bencherif, Julien
Boisselier, Serge Riaboukine and Pom Klementieff.

11
00:05:04,615 --> 00:05:10,615
Sleepless Night was premiered in 2011 at the Toronto International Film
Festival and  received positive reviews from critics.

12
00:05:32,307 --> 00:05:38,307
The tone is lighthearted and dark.
